<title>UK: UK stocks fall 897 mln stg in third quarter.</title>
<headline>UK stocks fall 897 mln stg in third quarter.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The level of total stocks in the UK production, construction and distribution industries fell by 897 million stg in the third quarter, the Office for National Statistics said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Following is a breakdown of UK stocks (seasonally adjusted in millions stg) --</p>
<p>				Q3 1996	 Q2 1996	   Q3 1995</p>
<p>    Total		    -897	    -149		1,255</p>
<p>    Mining &amp; quarrying    -69		17		  -10</p>
<p>    Manufacturing	  -228	    -215		  895</p>
<p>    Elec, gas &amp; water     -37	     -10		  -23</p>
<p>    Construction	   -182	     -65		 -108</p>
<p>    Motor trades	    122	    -102		  127</p>
<p>    Wholesaling	    -362	     206		  156</p>
<p>    Retailing		-141		20		  218</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
